rder-radius:50%;background:#EEB41E;border:2px solid #F7F4EA\"></span></a>\n</div>\n<dc-import name=\"AHV Chrome Footer\" hint-size=\"100%,560px\"></dc-import>\n</div>\n","logic":"\nclass Component extends DCLogic {\n  state = { q: '', cur: 'INR' };\n  componentDidMount() {\n    document.documentElement.lang = 'en-US';\n    this._onScroll = () => { const on = window.scrollY > 620; if (on !== this.state.wOn) this.setState({ wOn: on }); };\n    window.addEventListener('scroll', this._onScroll, { passive: true });\n    this._onScroll();\n  }\n  componentWillUnmount() { window.removeEventListener('scroll', this._onScroll); }\n  renderVals() {\n    const A = 'https://ayurvedichealingvillage.com';\n    // Pricing: Codex yoga-hub drop 31 Aug (Yoga Tariff V4 2026-27, from-totals at minimum stay; prospective, valid 1 Oct 2026 – 30 Sep 2027)\n    const cards = [\n      { title: 'Digestive Wellness & Gut Health Yoga Therapy', sub: 'Agni Dipanam Yoga Chikitsa', href: A + '/digestive-wellness-gut-health-yoga-therapy/', img: '/ahv/assets/img/digestive.webp', alt: 'Digestive Wellness & Gut Health Yoga Therapy Agni Dipanam Yoga Chikitsa', excerpt: 'Therapeutic yoga for digestion and gut balance. Asanas, breathwork, and Ayurvedic diet to rekindle agni.', nights: 14, from: { INR: '₹3,18,920', USD: '$4,550', EURO: '€3,990' } },\n      { title: 'Yoga-Based Stress & Energy Reset Program', sub: 'Prana Samya Yoga Chikitsa', href: A + '/yoga-based-stress-energy-reset-program/', img: '/ahv/assets/img/y-based.webp', alt: 'Yoga-Based Stress & Energy Reset Program  Prana Samya Yoga Chikitsa', excerpt: 'A yoga-led reset for stress and low energy. Daily practice, pranayama, and rest to restore prana balance.', nights: 7, from: { INR: '₹1,59,460', USD: '$2,275', EURO: '€1,995' } },\n      { title: 'Yoga & Meditation Training Program', sub: '', href: A + '/yoga-meditation-training/', img: '/ahv/assets/img/yoga-training-program.jpg', alt: 'Yoga & Meditation Training Program', excerpt: 'Structured yoga and meditation training with Kairali teachers. Practice, philosophy, and technique in one programme.', nights: 7, from: { INR: '₹1,50,430', USD: '$2,149', EURO: '€1,883' } },\n      { title: 'Kairali’s Personalized Yoga Program', sub: '', href: A + '/yoga-retreats/', img: '/ahv/assets/img/immunity.webp', alt: 'Kairali’s Personalized Yoga Program', excerpt: 'A yoga programme designed around you. Practice, pranayama, and meditation customised to your goals after a doctor’s assessment.', meta: 'Tailored programme — fee follows the doctor’s plan' },\n      { title: 'Kairali’s Yoga & Meditation Package', sub: 'Dhyana – Yoga Shibiram', href: A + '/yoga-and-meditation-package/', img: '/ahv/assets/img/yoga-meditation.webp', alt: 'Kairali’s Yoga & Meditation Package  Dhyana – Yoga Shibiram', excerpt: 'Kairali’s guided yoga and meditation package. Sunrise group yoga, pranayama, and evening meditation, day by day.', nights: 7, from: { INR: '₹1,50,430', USD: '$2,149', EURO: '€1,883' } }\n    ];\n    const syn = [\n      ['digestion', 'gut', 'bloating', 'stomach', 'agni'],\n      ['stress', 'energy', 'fatigue', 'burnout', 'prana'],\n      ['training', 'teacher', 'learn', 'course'],\n      ['retreat', 'personalized', 'customized', 'custom', 'private'],\n      ['meditation', 'mindfulness', 'dhyana', 'shibiram', 'package']\n    ];\n    cards.forEach((c, i) => { c.syn = syn[i]; c.wa = 'https://wa.me/919289838797?text=' + encodeURIComponent('Hello, I’d like to check whether the ' + c.title + ' is suitable for me.'); });\n    const norm = s => s.toLowerCase().replace(/[’']/g, '').replace(/[^a-z0-9 ]/g, ' ').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim();\n    const cur = this.state.cur;\n    cards.forEach(c => { if (c.from) c.meta = 'Minimum stay: ' + c.nights + ' nights · From ' + c.from[cur]; });\n    // owner 31 Aug: sort cheapest -> most expensive; unpriced (personalised) card last\n    cards.sort((a, b) => (a.from ? parseInt(a.from.INR.replace(/[^0-9]/g, ''), 10) : Infinity) - (b.from ? parseInt(b.from.INR.replace(/[^0-9]/g, ''), 10) : Infinity));\n    const currencies = [['₹ INR','INR'],['$ USD','USD'],['€ EURO','EURO']].map(([label, key]) => ({\n      label, on: cur === key,\n      bg: cur === key ? '#5A4420' : '#fff', fg: cur === key ? '#F7F4EA' : '#2A2118', bd: cur === key ? '#5A4420' : '#C9BFA8',\n      pick: () => this.setState({ cur: key })\n    }));\n    const q = norm(this.state.q);\n    const programs = q.length < 3 ? cards : cards.filter(c => {\n      const hay = norm(c.title + ' ' + c.sub + ' ' + c.excerpt);\n      return hay.includes(q) || c.syn.some(s => s.includes(q) || q.includes(s));\n    });\n    const n = programs.length;\n    return {\n      wOpacity: this.state.wOn ? 1 : 0, wVisibility: this.state.wOn ? 'visible' : 'hidden', wPointer: this.state.wOn ? 'auto' : 'none',\n      q: this.state.q,\n      setQ: e => this.setState({ q: e.target.value }),\n      programs, currencies, noResults: n === 0, minusOne: -1,\n      countLine: q.length < 3 ? '' : (n ? n + ' programme' + (n > 1 ? 's' : '') + ' may be relevant — a physician confirms suitability' : '0 programmes match'),\n      heritageYears: new Date().getFullYear() - 1908\n    };\n  }\n}\n","props":"","scripts":[]}